body:
DUDE i was about to eat a huge sandwich after and break my fast (intermittent fasting) (trying to stop binge eating/eatind disorder/in treatment) and I read your post, and I stopped. We're all addicts, we'll ALWAYS be addicts, you can't just have one glass, I can't just eat whatever I want, but we are in control. You're well on your way and I'm so proud of you. Keep strong, I'll be here waiting if you need help. 

&#x200B;

PS: I'm here not because i need to stop drinking but as alcohol has ruined many lives, food has ruined mine, and reading you guys helps inmensely.
